1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,180
Welcome, everybody, to this staff meeting.

2
00:00:02,615 --> 00:00:09,200
I have to add a new item to the agenda since I received several complaints yesterday about the state of the lunchroom.

3
00:00:10,030 --> 00:00:18,540
I'm not going to name anybody at this meeting, but I have to say that I, too, am also disappointed by the behavior of certain staff members.

4
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:24,630
The lunchroom is a shared facility and one which provides all of us with a valuable service.

5
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,260
Let's keep it clean!

6
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:28,580
If you make a mess, clean it up.

7
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:33,820
If you read the newspaper, return it to the table folded neatly when you have finished with it.

8
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:37,040
If you use the sink, make sure you leave it clean.

9
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:44,060
This is a question of basic good manners, and I hope I never have to speak to anybody here again about it!
